# Agent tooling is repository material, not site material. Vercel serves this project
# statically from the repository root — https://built2buy-public.vercel.app/generate-commission.mjs
# returns 200 today — so anything committed here is a candidate for being served on a
# world-readable site with no login and no recall. Repo-root markdown is not served in
# practice, but "not served in practice" is a property of Vercel's handling that could
# change under us, and this site is the one place where being wrong about that is
# unrecoverable. Keep the tooling out of the deployment rather than relying on it.
.claude
CLAUDE.md
AGENTS.md
.github
.vercelignore
